  "open_questions": [
    "Supplier: Section 1 of DL2-15021.pdf p.1 lists several Afton entities under 'Manufacturer / Supplier' (first: Afton Chemical Asia Pte. Ltd.; also Afton Chemical Corporation, Richmond, VA). Confirm which name to record.",
    "Only an SDS is in the archive for HiTEC 12010 (DL2-15021.pdf). No TDS/product bulletin, so package type, claims, SAE grades, treat rates, co-components and published formulations are all missing; these could be looked up later in an Afton product bulletin.",
    "TBN, sulfated ash, all elements (Ca, Mg, Zn, P, B, Mo, N, S) and pour point are not printed in DL2-15021.pdf; Section 9 (p.6-7) has no pour point entry.",
    "DL2-15021.pdf p.2 Section 3 lists 'Phosphorodithioic acid, mixed O,O-bis(2-ethylhexyl and iso-Bu and iso-Pr) esters, zinc salts' (CAS 85940-28-9) at 10 - 15 %. This is a ZDDP component share, not Zn or P element content, so Zn/P stay Missing.",
    "DL2-15021.pdf p.2 Section 3 lists two base-oil carriers (hydrotreated heavy paraffinic 64742-54-7, 15 - 25 %; solvent-dewaxed heavy paraffinic 64742-65-0, 15 - 25 %) and p.15 (Korea ISHL) lists 'Mineral oil 35 - 45' %. The package templates have no carrier field.",
    "Density: the old Product_JSON gives 1044 kg/m3 (converted); the sheet prints 1.044 g/cm³ at 15°C (p.6). Same value, kept in the printed unit."
  ],
